==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|is|non|stuttr}}, from {{inh|is|gem-pro|*stuntaz}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈstʏhtʏr/|lang=is}}
*: {{rhymes|ʏhtʏr|lang=is}}

===Adjective===
{{is-adj|styttri|stystur}}

# [[short]]
#: ''Hárið mitt er '''stutt'''.''
#:: My hair is '''short'''.
#: ''Hann kom við í morgun og spjallaði við mig '''stutta''' stund.''
#:: He came by this morning and chatted with me for a '''short''' while.''

